// --- Brick collision resolution (pure, testable) ----------------------------

// Resolves the ball against every live brick it overlaps, exactly ONCE per
// pass and per axis. The axis is the one with the smallest penetration
// (ox vs oy); equal penetrations mean a corner hit, and BOTH axes flip.
// The ball is pushed back out of the brick along the flipped axis so it never
// re-overlaps on the next pass, and the brick is destroyed with its score.
export function resolveBricks(state) {
